    "chunk_text": "den w\u00e6s fram \u00feam Se halga wer \u00fea nolde habban \u00feone sc\u00e6t, ne hine eac ne forseah, ac sealde \u00fe\u00e6t feoh eall for \u00dea b\u00e6don \u00fea gebro\u00fera \u00feone bisceop georne \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6s feos sumne d\u00e6l dyde into mynstre, cw\u00e6don \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga wer him to andsware, fede us ure cyrce, and scryde us ure cyrce, and we of \u00feysum Hw\u00e6t wille we lencg writan be Martines wundrum, \u00feonne Sulpicius s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t hi synd ungerime, and Ac we willa\u00f0 nu secgan be his for\u00f0si\u00f0e. Martinus se eadiga wiste his geendunga lange \u00e6r he for\u00f0ferde of \u00feysum life to Criste; and he cydde \u00dea w\u00e6ron on \u00feam timan \u00e6t Condatensem mynstre \u00fea preostas ungehw\u00e6re, and he \u00feider si\u00f0ode, He ferde \u00f0a \u00feiderwerd mid sumum gebro\u00f0rum, \u00fea geseah he scealfran swimman on anum flode, and \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga wer to his geferum \u00feus, \u00feas fugelas habba\u00f0 feonda gelicnysse \u00fee syrwia\u00f0 \u00e6fre \u00dea bebead Martinus \u00feam m\u00e6\u00f0leasum scealfrum, \u00fe\u00e6t hi geswicon \u00fe\u00e6s fixno\u00f0es, and si\u00feedon to Mid \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan h\u00e6se he afligde \u00fea scealfran mid \u00fe\u00e6re \u00fee he deofla adr\u00e6fde of mannum. Martinus \u00fea si\u00f0\u00f0an to \u00feam mynstre becom, and wunode \u00fe\u00e6r sume hwile and gesibbode \u00fea preostas. Eft \u00f0a he ham wolde \u00fea wear\u00f0 he geuntrumod, and s\u00e6de his gebro\u00f0rum \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde",
